	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0203_poke4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンは　いわかべを　かけあがり
ほらあなの　どこかへ　きえてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　岩壁を　駆け上がり
洞穴の　どこかへ　消えてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
