				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・ポケモンを倒した場合</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:26" />
		</CommentCell>
